006294              END-IF
006295           END-IF
006296           IF C6SP01A-DTINIRIC = C6SP01A-DTFINRIC
006297              MOVE WS-DTFINE-VALO      TO WMIN-DTFINE
006298           ELSE
006299              IF WS-DTFINE-VALO > WB-DTFINE(WB-IND)
006300                 MOVE WB-DTFINE(WB-IND)
006301                                       TO WMIN-DTFINE
006302              ELSE
